    // The prompt's first two words from the label's: an upper shift, the M and the first digit;
    // then the label's third code, a space or the second digit, a space and a lower shift.
    lac dnL
    add [MPKLABEL]
    dac dnL
    lac i dnL
    dac dnL
    rar 6s
    and [07777]
    add [KCUP * 010000]
    dac dfNmPrm
    lac dnL
    and [077]
    ral 9s
    ral 3s
    add [KCSPACE * 0100 + KCLOW]
