    KBBLANK

// The pen keyboard closed (the main bank's ckDone). Cancel takes nothing. Define's picker, a
// master picked, gives the keyboard for its name (dfNmOpen), whose OK runs Define; Name's
// picker the same keyboard on Name's block (rnNmBlk), whose OK gives that master (dfNmOpen's
// argument, kept in its word) the name typed. Dwell's picker, a
// master picked (the keyboard's kbPick), gives Dwell's number keyboard for it (cyDwKb). OK on
// Seq's keyboard takes the sequence (cySeqIn); on Dwell's, master cyKbM's dwell, when it is a
// number of DWELLMIN or more. A text refused leaves the value as it was.
