rtn, jmp .
    endloc

// Stiff's keyboard closed (the main bank's stDone). Cancel takes nothing; OK the stiffness typed,
// up to two digits, a point and at most one digit after it, at least one digit in all, 0.1 to
// STIFFMAX tenths. Anything else is refused, the stiffness kept.
// Entry: AC = 1 for OK, 0 for Cancel. Exit: AC = the parameter word, CUNUSED ORed with the
// tenths, or alone for 1.0; 0 for none. IO is clobbered. Called via jda.
