// Remove instance i. The last takes its place in the tables and in slot i, and the last slot is
// written unused, its gate first. Slot i's gate steps over its call while its other words
// change, so no frame draws a master at another's origin, where it could leave the screen; a
// frame between the steps draws the last instance twice. None is lit afterward. The caller
// spreads the target calls again (respread). Its tie points are listed, once each, in tgList,
// for Delete's arcOrphans; its ties leave the solver's, whose variables past MAXPTS move with
